#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651112"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651216"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651352"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651396"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651536"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651656"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651756"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651948"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652012"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652092"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652208"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652336"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652380"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652508"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652636"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652744"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652832"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652924"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653072"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653156"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653288"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653388"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653548"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653676"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653768"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653900"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654000"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654208"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654332"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654464"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654556"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654680"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654760"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654864"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654952"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "655072"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "655156"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "655236"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "655304"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "655344"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "655376"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655408"
msgid "You actually came. You don't get tired of\nstealing looks at people's secrets, stomping\nall the way into the depths of their mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655540"
msgid "If this place had any laws, you'd get prison\nand manual labor for eternity, but――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655624"
msgid "Be grateful this is the inside of my mind.\nI'm lenient. I'll let this petty insult,\nthis child's play, slide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655736"
msgid "This is the #C236196003Rin#CDEF I remember.\nDifferent from the mentally and emotionally\nunstable #C236196003Rin#CDEF up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655868"
msgid "Brimming with confidence, vigilant of her surroundings,\nnever letting herself get provoked…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655964"
msgid "There's no doubt: that's the real #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF!―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656036"
msgid "A sensible #C236196003Rin#CDEF finally shows up. Though there is\nnot much to discuss at this point, let us try\nasking her a few things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656172"
msgid "Why have you dragged my Praetor to the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF? I know you are aiming\nfor something, #C236196003Rin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656308"
msgid "It looks like it's her Real Mind this time.\nLet's ask her a few things before we fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656396"
msgid "Why did you summon us to the #C000246204Far Side of\nthe Moon#CDEF? What's your goal, #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656512"
msgid "Lenient, she says. Well then,\nbefore we do this, let's take a moment\nto clear up a few uncertainties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656616"
msgid "This should be better than speaking with\na mere clone. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, was there not\nsomething you wanted to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656740"
msgid "Such as, why were you dropped into the #C000246204Far Side\nof the Moon#CDEF? Or, this woman who calls herself\nQueen of the Moon―what is her objective?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656892"
msgid "You're all worker ants who'll serve me.\nSlaves forced to labor for me until their last\nbreath, here on the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657040"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF said it as if it was obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657092"
msgid "It's no different than bleeding out the NPCs\nand Masters of their blood in that torture chamber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657192"
msgid "…until now, I would avert my eyes,\nthinking to myself, \"This isn't the real #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\"\nBut that was a mistake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657316"
msgid "Whether she's real or fake,\nany #C236196003Rin#CDEF that says those kinds of things\ndeserves a hard slap in the face…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657436"
msgid "Look at that――\nThere's no more hesitation in your eyes.\nIt wouldn't be interesting otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657532"
msgid "I'm going to work you all to the bone\nexpanding this Labyrinth. Then I'll reach the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's Core and obtain the whole system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657680"
msgid "Great power must only be managed by the chosen.\nThose of a lineage, entrusted with\nthe responsibility of governance: nobles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657808"
msgid "Well, honestly speaking, it's a big pain in\nthe neck, and I personally want to destroy it…\nbut for some reason, I HAVE to control it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657944"
msgid "Right. You two should follow #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's example\nand call me Queen instead of #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF.\nDo that, and I'll spare your life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658100"
msgid "Go on, say it. In a loud voice,\nas if you were singing my praises.\nThis is your last chance, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658220"
msgid "……#C236196003Rin#CDEF looks down on me. She appears composed,\nbut as a matter of fact, her eyes are darting about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658340"
msgid "I should say―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "658360"
msgid "Your Majesty, please calm yourself."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "658396"
msgid "Your Majesty, have you not been deceived?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "658440"
msgid "So how are you liking that mini-skirt?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658480"
msgid "I am calm!\nI'm calmer and more tranquil than the sea!\nThat reply kinda pisses me off!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658568"
msgid "Deceived… Th-there's no way that could happen!\nI'm the absolute #C000246204Queen of the Moon#CDEF, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658680"
msgid "I said call me QUEEEEN! Are you a monster!?\nIf you at least did as I say in the end,\nI wouldn't have to punish you, you know!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658808"
msgid "…this discussion really is going nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658852"
msgid "All that's left now is to decide who wins and loses by force.\nBut… there's one last thing I want to confirm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658964"
msgid "Eh? How stupid, of course I want to be a Queen\ninstead of a princess. After all, princesses\ncan't use the country's budget as they like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659104"
msgid "―――Alright. Let's take her down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659140"
msgid "I think that's what's best for the world,\nthe people, and the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659232"
msgid "That's the spirit! However, #C236196003Rin#CDEF―a nation's\ntreasury belongs to the people and the future.\nNo one, even a queen, may misappropriate it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659384"
msgid "I'll warn you: that way of thinking will only\nlead to ruin. Well, I DID use my treasury\nwhimsically, though!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659496"
msgid "Good grief. If there's no bread, then \"let them\neat cake.\" You know the name of the queen who\nmade that gaffe?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659608"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF. I bear you no ill will,\nbut this a good opportunity to reform that\nunruly act of yours, here and now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659740"
msgid "Ah! A new type of beautiful courtesan…!\nI seeee. You may be an honest girl, but being\ngreedy about money ruins a country, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659868"
msgid "Nothing ever goes as planned, and even with\nfinishing touches, jewels still have flaws.\nFor #C236196003Rin#CDEF's sake, we cleanse her heart of evil!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660020"
msgid "Well! Now we're in agreement, mongrel!\nYou truly are the woman I judged you to be.\nYou understand how to use wealth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660140"
msgid "However―――THAT is why I cannot ignore it.\nYour principles are based on self-pleasure. You\nmake a very woman-like, emotional argument."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660280"
msgid "Kings rule over wealth with their ambition.\nQueens consume wealth through their#RUBS placentas#RUBE wombs#REND.\nBy my hand, I will show you the difference!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660436"
msgid "The heck, now I look like the bad guy…!\nFine. Now that it's come to this,\nlet's see who's right and who's wrong!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660552"
msgid "Let's do this, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF! We'll prove to them\nthat we're the chosen nobles!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660644"
msgid "Ugh… What's with this focused intent #[he][she]# \nhas…!? #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF is different than usual―\n#[H-he][Sh-she]#'s kind of cool, maybe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660796"
msgid "Hey, what am I saying!?\nI can't let my guard down.\nI need to reject #[him][her]# as hard as I can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660896"
msgid "First, let's review."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660920"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF wants to collect more wealth… more cash than\nshe really needs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661004"
msgid "She keeps saying that the only thing she believes in is money.\nWhat's that called, again?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "661096"
msgid "Money Worship"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "661112"
msgid "Immorality Worship"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661132"
msgid "I don't have any interests like THAT! I never\nsaid that I enjoy seeing people suffer and\nstuff! I mean, that's just evil. Plain evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661268"
msgid "I messed up because it sounded kind of similar.\nThe right answer is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661344"
msgid "Going to the movies with #C236196003Rin#CDEF, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661396"
msgid "That might be fun to do once we get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661448"
msgid "This is―what is it called―obviously…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "661488"
msgid "Templation (Overly Self-conscious)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661524"
msgid "Hee hee… So you finally realized\nhow charming I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661580"
msgid "I don't remember seducing you, but just me\nstanding here makes you weak in the knees…\nIt's scary how prominent of a character I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661716"
msgid "Sure, I think she would be very captivating \nif she would just stay quiet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661792"
msgid "The mini skirt, the leather boots―\nSometimes, even I think it's a bit much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661872"
msgid "But unfortunately, this wasn't the right choice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661924"
msgid "The right answer is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661952"
msgid "No, that's not how it is at all.\nPromises, tsunderes――\nDon't decide who people are for them!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662048"
msgid "All I'm doing is what I want to do!\nI decide for myself, I prepare myself, I take\nresponsibility… What's wrong with that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662172"
msgid "It's everyone's duty to be the one who\ndominates themselves. Abandoning that duty\njust means being lazy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662280"
msgid "\n\n\nTo be human\nis to sometimes want to slack off.\n                                    -#C236196003#NICK#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662392"
msgid "That's why she jumps from extreme to extreme,\nplacing herself in positions that contradict\nwho she truly is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662508"
msgid "She possesses a desire that seems to seek taboo."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "662560"
msgid "Submission Desire"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "662580"
msgid "Domination Desire"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662600"
msgid "Do so, and I'm fine with letting\nyou leave this place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662656"
msgid "That was the wrong choice.\nI mustn't coddle #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662724"
msgid "The right answer is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662752"
msgid "How can my decisions, impressions, actions,\nemotions―even one gram of blood, one teardrop\nfrom my head to my toes NOT belong to me――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662888"
msgid "No matter how sweet it would be to do so, I\nwould lose my dignity. …no, I wouldn't even be\nhuman anymore, so why would I care…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663020"
msgid "It's all a fleeting trick of her imagination.\nNothing more than taboo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663092"
msgid "Wah………!!!!?\nW-w-why are you yelling all of a sudden!??\nAnd \"bitch,\" you called me a \"bitch\"!??"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663192"
msgid "………#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI think you just said the worst word there is\nright to the bitch's face. Maybe I misheard?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663316"
msgid "That's not better. Why would that be better?\nAlso, I'm seriously disappointed in you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663404"
msgid "You're going to look at these slender,\nbeautiful legs and call me a pig?\nYou really have no eye for these things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663520"
msgid "Anything a person like you says to me will\ntick me off. Call me a pig, or a hippo,\nor whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663628"
msgid "Although―――in exchange, I'll kill you.\nI WILL kill you. I will kill you,\nand it will be messy, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663752"
msgid "I need to attack with confidence until the end!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663800"
msgid "I-I don't know anything about that!\nI'm just a logical, elegant money-worshipper,\nnot some bitch…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663900"
msgid "You're wrong, you're WRONG! Why do I feel\nso relieved about getting scolded!?\nThis isn't―this isn't me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664008"
msgid "N-no! You're wrong, you're definitely wrong!\nI'm always logical!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664076"
msgid "I accidentally made her self-confidence resurface.\nThis won't work. She's going to revert\nback into the troublesome queen she was before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664216"
msgid "Why do you keep saying horrible things to me!?\nWhy! Why won't you look at the real me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664304"
msgid "\"What I'm saying isn't the same as what I'm doing.\n Still, please understand my inner thoughts―――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664408"
msgid "She's acting like a spoiled brat.\nThe #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF I knew never whined like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664508"
msgid "That what's so kind and beautiful about #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664580"
msgid "But what about right now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664608"
msgid "She keeps pushing only HER thoughts,\nand when confronted, she bawls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664680"
msgid "How can anyone properly think about their future like that?\nRidiculous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664752"
msgid "Right now, all #C236196003Rin#CDEF is thinking about is herself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664820"
msgid "L-listen―――\nEven I want to take it easy once in a while…\nI wanted to be honest with myself…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664920"
msgid "What!? What's wrong with that!?\nIt's fine to think about your own needs!\nIt's natural to think that you're the cutest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665040"
msgid "Ohhh, well then we've got great chemistry☆\nMe, the cute one, and you, the whatever one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665132"
msgid "Hee hee hee… and I'll be paying you back\nbig time for that verbal lashing you gave me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665220"
msgid "Maaan, still, you surprised me there. I had no\nidea there was actually a hypocrite around here\nwho \"values others above themselves.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665356"
msgid "Damn! This will ruin everything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665392"
msgid "Uhh, the right answer is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665424"
msgid "I don't want to take responsibility… I won't\nbecome honest that way… With responsibility,\nI can't say what I want to say…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665552"
msgid "Despite bearing both the responsibility of guiding people\nAND being hated by people, #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF still has her pride."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665688"
msgid "I think I'm cute. I realized that it's\nonly natural! At this point, what does it\nmatter what's right or wrong―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665804"
msgid "It's natural to think, \"I'm the cutest.\"\nBut that's nothing to be ashamed of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665884"
msgid "If there's anything to actually be embarrassed about,\nit's people who think, \"only I'm cute.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665980"
msgid "It's because she can't ignore the potential\nin the person she's looking at."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666056"
msgid "Okay… That's fine, then…\nThis is who I am…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666104"
msgid "Even though I'm actually weak,\nI try my best to look tough.\nI'll look tough to the very end―that's me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666212"
msgid "Isn't that right? That's who #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is.\nThese are my beliefs,\nthe beliefs I like the most―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666332"
msgid "Ahh… It feels good,\nbut it's embarrassing…\nI can't believe that I'm fully exposed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666420"
msgid "But this is fine, right…?\nThe one thing I can't change is who I am\ndeep down… I'm fine with this―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666528"
msgid "You'll probably forget this once you leave here,\nbut I'm grateful.\nThank you for setting me free, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666652"
msgid "…yeah. Just let me say this one last thing:\nlet me give you one good smack after this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666740"
msgid "Nope, no more chances.\nYou'll be saying no more. Hey, just what have\nyou been seeing in me this whole time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666848"
msgid "Understand? Regardless of whatever proverb\nyou whip out, you won't be making a single\nripple of discord in my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666964"
msgid "―――Dead end. You should've software updated\nyour head with some common sense\nbefore you went calling people \"dogs.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667084"
msgid "It's proof that #C236196003Rin#CDEF's mind has been completely closed off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667160"
msgid "Just now, the world completely changed.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF isn't here. #C236196003#SVT#CDEF isn't here.\nI don't even feel any sense of reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667308"
msgid "Yeah. Even your Servant can't help you here.\nIt's a one-on-one in a secret room―\nbetween you and the genuine article, me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667432"
msgid "Or maybe I should say \"prison.\"\nSorry, but no exit here. This is my mind.\nYou're trapped in here for life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667540"
msgid "I see… This is the center of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667600"
msgid "…y-you're pretty relaxed. No one's coming\nto rescue you, you know? There's no exit,\nyou know? Aren't you gonna panic?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667720"
msgid "Because―――if this is the center of her mind,\nall I have to do is defeat #C236196003Rin#CDEF with words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667828"
msgid "Well, rather than defeat―I mean physically punish.\nI don't know the reason why, but #C236196003Rin#CDEF injured many NPCs\nand did a number on me as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667984"
msgid "Time for some retribution.\nSince this is #C236196003Rin#CDEF's mind, there's nowhere she can run…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668084"
msgid "I'll completely refute anything you say to me!\nThen I'll turn the tables on you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668168"
msgid "The stagnation in her mind turned into thorns to repel me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668228"
msgid "…don't worry, I have enough of a shot at winning.\nI'll make good use of the #C000246204SGs#CDEF that I've collected\nup until now and make #C236196003Rin#CDEF repent…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668400"
msgid "I rush over to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and help her sit up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668456"
msgid "Huh―#C236196003#NICK#CDEF…?\n…why am I… If I recall correctly,\nI contracted with that red #C236196003Lancer#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668576"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, what's up with me?\nAnd hey, where are we?\nWhat happened up until now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668672"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF seems to have forgotten about #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668748"
msgid "Since hiding things would make her angry somewhere down the line,\nI explained everything that happened up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668868"
msgid "Particularly, about how she declared herself Queen,\nand about the Money-Is-Power system, in detail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668968"
msgid "What? Are you telling me none of that\nwas just a dream!? I didn't actually do\nall those crazy things, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669080"
msgid "Yes, you did them. You were quite different\nthan usual, #C236196003Rin#CDEF. Your desires were laid bare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669188"
msgid "There's no doubt that it all happened.\n…well, for me, it was a bad nightmare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669268"
msgid "On the contrary, it all actually happened鷙\nPlease be mature and accept it, #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nDon't worry―a rumor only lasts nine days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669408"
msgid "Nothing to be ashamed of, #C236196003Rin#CDEF. Hmph… To think\nthat I would speak a name other than that of\nmy contractor. That's how grand it all was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669560"
msgid "Ah…. aaaahhhhh….\nShamed… I'm shamed for life…\nWhy did I do all of that stuuuuuff…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669652"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF reflects on things, with great vexation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669716"
msgid "This sorry sight of hers is enough to make me\nwant to write off all her past misdeeds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669804"
msgid "In any case, the battle is over now.\nAll that's left is to have #C236196003Rin#CDEF take us out of here,\nreturn to the school, and leave the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nThen everything will be settled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670016"
msgid "\"Well, all that matters it that you're back to normal now.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670076"
msgid "Everything will be settled… Ah! That's right!\nWe have something more important to finish!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670168"
msgid "We need to do something about her―and fast.\nWe won't be able to leave for eternity…\nNo, it'll be even worse than that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670292"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is outside as well, right!?\nI need to speak to him, fast…\nAh―how do we get out of here again!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670412"
msgid "C-couldn't you just hit me? Alright,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF―hit me! If you hit me hard enough\nto knock me out, I should wake up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670544"
msgid "What's the big hurry? If it's time you need,\nwe've got an infinite amount of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670628"
msgid "Let's calm ourselves, #C000246204Queen of the Moon#CDEF.\nNo matter how much you all struggle, you won't\nmake it in time to do a single thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670772"
msgid "What was―that voice just now…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670808"
msgid "We should be the only ones in here.\nWhat on Earth is going on here―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670884"
msgid "――It's her. The main culprit behind pulling\nall the Masters into the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\ncapturing and placing me in the Labyrinth―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671040"
msgid "You're here, so don't you remember? In the Holy\nGrail War, when we were attacked by those black\nmonsters―didn't you hear a woman's voice?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671180"
msgid "Yeah. That voice―from the roof, engulfed in Black Noise.\nThat voice was the same as this one now…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671284"
msgid "Yes, that's right.\nI'm the culprit who troubled you all so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671344"
msgid "I'm half of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―――\nThe one who rules the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF:\nthe real #C000246204Queen of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671496"
msgid "Nice to meet you, sad little lamb.\nAnd welcome, to the lovely #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671592"
msgid "…! #C236196003#NICK#CDEF, forget the hitting.\nIf we leave now, she'll catch us again!\nLet's wait things out for now―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671716"
msgid "What good will waiting things out do you?\nYOU were the one in such a big hurry, #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671820"
msgid "Well, I don't really care about\nsomeone like you anyway, #C236196003Rin#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671904"
msgid "And there's a first-timer here as well.\nSince this is a first-time service,\nthey deserve some special treatment!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672020"
msgid "Neither my strength or #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's\nhave recovered to what they used to be,\nbut we still took #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF head-on and crushed them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672200"
msgid "*sigh*. We lost. Well, it's okay.\nIt's a rehearsal, after all.\nThis was merely the opening act."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672296"
msgid "Later, #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nWe were only partners for a little while,\nbut you were kind of cute."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672396"
msgid "Praetor. The rest is up to you.\nDefeating her Servant will not bring resolution\nto her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672492"
msgid "Now―strike at her thoughts without hesitation.\nDefeat #C236196003Rin#CDEF's heart through your words!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672596"
msgid "…her Servant abandoned her, and now her\nheart won't submit… She's as tenacious as\nI thought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672692"
msgid "Master. The only thing we can rely on now\nare your words. Go on and smash her congealed\nheart to pieces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672800"
msgid "She's outrageously gutsy…\nI guess it's impossible to reform #C236196003Rin#CDEF's heart\nthrough a mere show of force."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672920"
msgid "I see that this is your time to shine, Darling.\nPlease use those cool, verbal abuses of yours\nto turn this tsun-tsun #C236196003Rin#CDEF dere!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673064"
msgid "Still struggling, I see. Until the very end,\nyou make for an impressive doe. I lament not\nbeing concerned with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673180"
msgid "However, this is now #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's duty.\nDefeating you, humiliating you―it is all what\nthis #[man][woman]# desired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673312"
msgid "Lo, the final strike is yours, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nGive her your pity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673388"
msgid "Encouraged by #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, I approach #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673456"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF disappeared. There are no longer any threats.\nIf I can just persuade #C236196003Rin#CDEF now,\nthen everything will be settled―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673612"
msgid "Don't under… estimate me…!\nIt's time to use my final resort―――\neven if I only take you down with me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673720"
msgid "…!\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF turns around right away, but it's too late."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673792"
msgid "My outstretched hand catches only air.\nLike a ship caught in a whirlpool,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's consciousness sank into darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673936"
msgid "Looks like we don't need a live concert. Once a\nthird-rate Servant, always third-rate…\nYou didn't even push me enough to sing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674064"
msgid "Was this to your liking, #C236196003Rin#CDEF? As the Queen\ndesired, I punished the ignorant fools with\nmy spear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674180"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's spear is pointed straight at the bottom\nof our necks. If we move in the slightest, we'll\nget stabbed in the head immediately."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674332"
msgid "But… this isn't enough to make us beg for our lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674388"
msgid "Due to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's defeat, my body also begins\nto rapidly lose its heat.\nServants and Masters share the same fate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674516"
msgid "Wrong. That only happens in the Near Side of the\nMoon. In the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, a Servant's\nannihilation was the Master's annihilation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674668"
msgid "Since the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF decided that Masters who\nlost their combat proxies have no value in\nbeing. But―this is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674836"
msgid "Does that mean being made to do hard labor\nuntil I die, maybe…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674904"
msgid "Wh-why would I do that?\nHey. Just what kind of person do you think I am?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674980"
msgid "…I'm not the only one that wants you.\nFirst up is the promise I made to present you\nto that person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675084"
msgid "Take it away, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF―stun #[him][her]#.\nAfter that, I'll stuff them into a box and take\nthem with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675204"
msgid "As you wish. Hehehe.\nGoodbye, sad little #[piggy][squirrely]#.\nWouldn't it have been so nice to die here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675312"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's spear mercilessly pierces my chest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675376"
msgid "―――With a sharp pain, my consciousness abruptly cuts out."
msgstr ""

